                                                "sense_id": "8ab1c065-bb11-3bf9-a5c0-f0dbafd580d5",
                                                "text": "In modern China, due to school teaching, the modern media and international mobility, the English language and the Latin alphabet are quickly gaining ground and with them acronymy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab60926c-fcca-353c-9dc1-70eeb1b0cfac",
                                        "entry_id": "6f22be0e-afc2-3163-af9f-2c8a3c5eaf61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The use of acronyms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d126ce03-3f1f-43e8-add2-d1c4074458fc",
                                                "sense_id": "ab60926c-fcca-353c-9dc1-70eeb1b0cfac",
                                                "text": "In some cases of acronymy, the initials are pronounced as in TKO for Technical Knock Out. In others, the initials and/or beginning segments are pronounced as the spelled word would be, like in UFO, Unidentified Flying Object."
                                            }
